                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-3 mt-1 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                            <div><h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">24/7 Support</h4><p class="text-blue-50 text-sm">We're here to help whenever you need</p></div>
